@k.parts.whole.wharf k.parts.whole name=wharf gloss="a platform built out from the shore into the water and supported by piles; provides access to ships and boats" has=bollard has=shipside core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.parts.whole.wheat k.parts.whole name=wheat gloss="annual or biennial grass having erect flower spikes and light brown grains" has="wheat berry" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.parts.whole.wheel k.parts.whole name=wheel gloss="a simple machine consisting of a circular frame with spokes (or a solid disc) that can rotate on a shaft or axle (as in vehicles or other machines)" has=felloe has=rim core.source="wordnet 3.1"
